   "text": "API: ASP.NET Core .NET 10 (MVC)\nRender (Docker): fde-tracker-api\n\nJWT verify · CORS allow-list · rate limits\n\nSubmissions + review · Reports\nFeed (batches, recommended)\nRecruitment assistant · Task assistant\nPractice lab (Day 1-3 runs)\nGuardrails: schema check, real quotes,\ninjection screen, confirm before delete",
   "originalText": "API: ASP.NET Core .NET 10 (MVC)\nRender (Docker): fde-tracker-api\n\nJWT verify · CORS allow-list · rate limits\n\nSubmissions + review · Reports\nFeed (batches, recommended)\nRecruitment assistant · Task assistant\nPractice lab (Day 1-3 runs)\nGuardrails: schema check, real quotes,\ninjection screen, confirm before delete",
